9:
N'ayogera nti
Kanani akolimirwe;
Anaabanga muddu w'abaddu eri baganda be.

Era yayogera nti
Mukama yeebazibwe, Katonda wa Seemu;
Era Kanani abeerenga muddu we.

Katonda agaziye Yafeesi,
Era atuulenga mu weema za Seemu;
Era Kanani abeerenga muddu we.

27:
Isaaka kitaawe n'addamu n'amugamba nti
Laba, ennyumba yo eneebanga ya bugimu bwa nsi,
Era ya musulo oguva mu ggulu waggulu;

N'ekitala kyo kye kinaakuwanga obulamu, era onooweerezanga muganda wo;
Era olulituuka bw'olyesumattula,
Olikunkumula ekikoligo kye okuva mu bulago bwo.

49:
Omulebevu ng'amazzi tolisinga;
Kubanga walinnya ku kitanda kya kitaawo:
N'okigwagwawaza: yalinnya ku kiriri kyange.

Ggwe emmeeme yange, tojjanga mu lukiiko lwabwe;
Ggwe ekitiibwa kyange, teweegattanga n'ekibiina kyabwe;
Kubanga olw'obusungu bwabwe batta omusajja,
N'olw'eddalu lyabwe baatema ente olunywa.

Yuda, ggwe baganda bo banaakutenderezanga:
Omukono gwo gunaabanga ku bulago bw'abalabe bo;
Abaana ba kitaawo banaakutamanga mu maaso go.

Zebbulooni anaatuulanga ku ttale ly'ennyanja:
Anaabanga omwalo ogw'amaato;
N'ensalo ye eneebanga ku Sidoni.

Yusufu lye ttabi eribala ennyo.
Ettabi eribala ennyo awali oluzzi;
Abaana be babuna bbugwe.

15:
Era n'omukka ogw'omu nnyindo zo amazzi gaalinnyisibwa.
Ebitaba ne biyimirira entuumo;
Obuziba ne bukwata mu mutima ogw'ennyanja.

Abakungu ab'omu Edomu ne balyoka beewuunya;
Ab'amaanyi ab'omu Mowaabu, okukankana kubakwata:
Abatuula mu Bukanani bonna bayenjebuka.

Okutekemuka n'entiisa bibaguddeko;
Mu bukulu obw'omukono gwo batudde ng'ejjinja;
Okutuusa abantu bo lwe balisomoka, Mukama,
Okutuusa abantu lwe balisomoka be weefunira.

Miryamu n'abaddamu nti
Muyimbire Mukama, kubanga yawangulidde ddala;
Embalaasi n'omwebagazi waayo yabisudde mu nnyanja.

23:
N'ayogera olugero lwe n'ayogera nti
Golokoka, Balaki, owulire;
Ntegera okutu, ggwe mutabani wa Zipoli:

24:
Kale Edomu aliba butaka,
Era ne Seyiri aliba butaka, abaali abalabe be;
Isiraeri ng'akola eby'obuzira.

N'atunuulira Amaleki, n'agera olugero lwe n'ayogera nti
Amaleki yali wa lubereberye mu mawanga;
Naye enkomerero ye ey'oluvannyuma erituuka mu kuzikirira.

32:
Yamulinnyisa ku bifo ebigulumivu eby'ensi,
N'alya ekyengera eky'ennimiro;
N'amunuunyanga omubisi gw'enjuki okuva mu lwazi,
N'amafuta okuva mu lwazi olw'embaalebaale;

Bankwasanga obuggya n'ekyo ekitali Katonda;
Bansunguwazanga n'ebigambo byabwe ebitaliimu:
Nange ndibakwasa obuggya eri abo abatali ggwanga;
Ndibasunguwaza n'eggwanga essirusiru.

33:
Weewaawo, ayagala amawanga;
Abatukuvu be bonna bali mu mukono gwo.
Ne batuula ku bigere byo;
Buli muntu aliweebwa ku bigambo byo.

10:
Awo Yoswa n'agamba Mukama ku lunaku Mukama lwe yawaayo Abamoli mu maaso g'abaana ba Isiraeri; n'ayogera mu maaso ga Isiraeri nti
Enjuba, yimirira ggwe ku Gibyoni;
Naawe, omwezi, mu kiwonvu Ayalooni.

5:
Muwulire, mmwe bakabaka; mutege amatu, mmwe abalangira;
Nze, nze, naayimbira Mukama;
Naayimba okutendereza Mukama, Katonda wa Isiraeri.

Zuukuka, zuukuka, Debola;
Zuukuka, zuukuka, yatula oluyimba:
Golokoka, Balaki, oyise obusibe bwo nga busibiddwa, ggwe mutabani wa Abinoamu.

Mu Efulayimu ne muva abo abalina ekikolo kyabwe mu Amaleki;
Nga bakugoberera ggwe, Benyamini, mu bika byo;
Mu Makiri (ne muva) abafuga ne baserengeta,
Ne mu Zebbulooni abo abakwata omuggo gw'oyo asimba ennyiriri.

N'abalangira ba Isakaali baali wamu ne Debola;
Nga Isakaali bwe yali, ne Balaki bwe yali bw'atyo;
Baafubutuka mu kiwonvu (nga balinnya) mu bigere bye.
Awali enzizi za Lewubeeni
Waabaawo okuteesa kw'emitima okukulu.

2:
Tewali mutukuvu nga Mukama;
Kubanga tewali mulala wabula ggwe:
So tewali lwazi oluliŋŋanga Katonda waffe.

Abakkutanga bapakasizza olw'emmere;
N'abo abaalumwanga enjala bakomye:
Weewaawo, omugumba azadde musanvu;
N'oyo alina abaana abangi ayongobera.

Alikuuma ebigere by'abatukuvu be,
Naye ababi balisirisibwa mu kizikiza;
Kubanga tewaliba muntu alisinga olw'amaanyi.

Abawakana ne Mukama balimenyekamenyeka;
Alibwatuka ku bo ng'ayima mu ggulu:
Mukama alisala omusango gw'enkomerero z'ensi;
Era alimuwa kabaka we amaanyi,
N'agulumiza ejjembe ly'oyo gwe yafukako amafuta.

22:
Katonda ow'olwazi lwange, oyo gwe nneesiganga;
Engabo yange, era ejjembe ery'obulokozi bwange, ekigo kyange ekiwanvu, era ekiddukiro kyange;
Omulokozi wange, ggwe omponya mu kyejo.

Katonda ekkubo lye lyatuukirira:
Ekigambo kya Mukama kyakemebwa;
Oyo ye ngabo eri abo bonna abamwesiga.

Era omponyezza mu kuwakana kw'abantu bange;
N'onkuuma okuba omutwe gw'amawanga:
Eggwanga lye ssimanyanga lirimpeereza.

23:
Mazima ennyumba yange si bw'eri bw'etyo eri Katonda;
Naye yalagaana nange endagaano eterivaawo,
Eyeeteeseteese mu byonna era ey'enkalakkalira;
Kubanga bwe bulokozi bwange bwonna era kye nneegomba kyonna,
Newakubadde nga takikuza.

Naye omuntu agakomako
Kimugwanira okubeerera ddala n'ekyuma n'olunyago lw'effumu;
Era galyokerwa ddala omuliro mu kifo kyago.

3:
Olunaku olwo lube ekizikiza;
Katonda aleme okulutunuulira ng'ayima waggulu,
So n'omusana guleme okulwakira.

Ekizikiza n'ekisiikirize eky'okufa biruyite olw'abyo;
Ekire kirutuuleko:
Byonna ebiddugaza obudde birutiise.

Ekiro ekyo ekizikiza ekikutte kikinyage:
So luleme okusanyukira mu nnaku ez'omu mwaka;
Luleme okutuuka mu muwendo gw'emyezi.

Emmunyeenye ez'ekiro kyalwo zibeeko ekizikiza:
Lunoonye omusana, naye lugubulwe;
So terutunuulira bikowe bya nkya:

4:
Gwayimirira buyimirizi, naye ne siyinza kwetegereza bwe gufaanana;
Ekifaananyi kyali mu maaso gange:
Waaliwo okusirika, ne mpulira eddoboozi eryogera nti

7:
Bwe ngalamira ne njogera nti
Naayimuka ddi? naye ekiro kirwawo;
Era nsula nneekubiira okukeesa obudde.

Kyennaava nnema okuziyiza akamwa kange;
Naayogeza obubalagaze bw'omwoyo gwange;
Neemulugunyisa obuyinike bw'emmeeme yange.

Era kiki ekikulobera okusonyiwa okusobya kwange n'okuggyawo obutali butuukirivu bwange?
Kubanga kaakano naagalamira mu nfuufu;
Naawe olinnoonyeza ddala, naye nze nga siriiwo.

8:
Singa obadde mulongoofu era wa mazima;
Teyandiremye nno okukuzuukukira,
N'awa omukisa ekifo omubeera obutuukirivu bwo.

9:
Ensi eweereddwayo mu mukono gw'omubi:
Abikka ku maaso g'abalamuzi baayo;
Oba nga si ye, kale ye ani?

10:
Emmeeme yange enyiye obulamu bwange;
Naafukumula okwemulugunya kwange;
Naayogeza kkabyo lya mmeeme yange.

Bwe mba omubi, nga zinsanze;
Era bwe mba omutuukirivu, era naye siriyimusa mutwe gwange;
Nga nswazibwa nnyo
Era nga ntunuulira ennaku ze ndaba.

Okomyawo buggya abajulirwa bo eri nze,
N'onnyongerako okunyiiga kwo;
Ebikyukakyuka n'obulwa biri nange.

Ensi ey'ekizikiza ekikutte, ng'ekizikiza kyennyini bwe kiri;
Ensi ey'ekisiikirize eky'okufa awatali kuteekateeka,
Era omusana gwayo guliŋŋanga ekizikiza.

12:
Naye nange nnina okutegeera so si mmwe mwekka;
Mmwe temunsinga:
Weewaawo, ani atamanyi ebiri ng'ebyo?

Eweema ez'abanyazi ziraba omukisa,
N'abo abanyiiza Katonda baba mirembe;
Katonda aleeta ebintu bingi mu mukono gwabwe.

14:
Kubanga ennaku ze zaateesebwa,
omuwendo gw'emyezi gye guli naawe,
Era wamuteekerawo ensalo ze z'atayinza kusukkako;

Amazzi gasiriiza amayinja;
Okwanjaala kwago kufumbiikiriza enfuufu ey'oku nsi:
Era ozikiriza essuubi ery'omuntu.

15:
Taavenga mu kizikiza;
Omuliro gunaakazanga amatabi ge,
Era anaavangawo olw'omukka ogw'omu kamwa ke.

16:
Antaagudde n'ekiruyi kye, anjigganyizza;
Era annumidde obujugu:
Omulabe wange ankanulira amaaso.

Banjasamidde akamwa kaabwe;
Bankubye empi nga banswaza:
Bankuŋŋaanirako.

Nali mpeeraweera n'anjasaamu wakati;
Weewaawo, yankwata mu nsingo n'antandaggira okummenyamenya:
Era ansimbye okuba sabbaawa ye.

Abalasi be banzingizza enjuyi zonna,
Ayasaamu ensigo zange so tasonyiwa;
Afuka omususa gwange ku ttaka.

20:
Aguggyamu ne guva mu mubiri gwe:
Weewaawo, omumwa gwagwo ogumasamasa guva mu mususa gwe;
Ebitiisa bimuliko.

Ekizikiza kyonna kyaterekerwa ebibye eby'obugagga:
Omuliro ogutakumibwa bantu gunaamwokyanga;
Gunaamalangawo ebyo ebisigadde mu weema ye.

24:
Laba, ng'entulege mu ddungu
Bafuluma eri omulimu gwabwe nga banoonyeza ddala eby'okulya;
Ensiko ebawa emmere ya baana baabwe.

Abo bali ku muwendo gw'abo abajeemera omusana;
Tebamanyi makubo gaagwo,
So tebabeerera mu mpenda zaagwo.

Mu kizikiza mwe basimira ennyumba:
Beggalira emisana;
Tebamanyi musana.

Aba wa mbiro ng'amazzi;
Omugabo gwabwe gukolimiddwa ku nsi:
Takyukira awali ekkubo ery'ensuku z'emizabbibu.

Olubuto lunaamwerabiranga; envunyu eneemulyanga ng'ewoomeddwa;
Tajjukirwenga nate:
Kale obutali butuukirivu bunaamenyekanga ng'omuti.

Bagulumizibwa; ne wayitawo ebbanga ttono nga bagenze;
Weewaawo, bakkakkanyizibwa, baggibwa mu kkubo ng'abalala bonna,
Era basalibwa ng'emitwe gy'ebirimba by'eŋŋaano.

28:
Basima obunnya obuli ewala n'abantu we batuula;
Beerabirwa ekigere ekiyitawo:
Balengejjera wala n'abantu, bawuubibwawuubibwa eruuyi n'eruuyi.

Era n'agamba abantu nti
Laba, okutya Mukama okwo ge magezi;
N'okuleka obubi kwe kutegeera.

30:
Ku mukono gwange ogwa ddyo kugolokokera abalalulalu;
Basindiikiriza ebigere byange,
Era batuuma ku nze amakubo gaabwe ag'okuzikirira.

Ebitiisa bikyuse okungwako,
Bayigganya ekitiibwa kyange ng'empewo;
N'omukisa gwange guweddewo ng'ekire.

32:
Awo Eriku mutabani wa Balakeri Omubuzi n'addamu n'ayogera nti
Nze ndi muto, nammwe muli bakadde nnyo;
Kyennavudde nzibiikiriza ne ssaŋŋanga kubalaga kye ndowooza.

33:
Mu kirooto, mu kwolesebwa okw'omu kiro,
Otulo otungi bwe tukwata abantu,
Nga babongoota ku kitanda;

Oba waliwo wamu naye malayika,
Omutegeeza, omu mu lukumi,
Okwolesa abantu ebibagwanira;

Asaba Katonda, era amukwatirwa ekisa;
N'okulaba alaba amaaso ge n'essanyu:
Era awa nate omuntu obutuukirivu bwe.

34:
Kale mumpulire, mmwe abasajja abalina okutegeera:
Kiddire eri awali Katonda, ye okukola obubi;
N'awali Omuyinza w'ebintu byonna, ye okukola ebitali bya butuukirivu.

Bafa mu kaseera akatono, mu ttuntu;
Abantu bakankanyizibwa ne bayitawo,
N'ab'amaanyi baggibwawo awatali mukono.

36:
Weewaawo, yandikuggye mu kulaba ennaku
N'akuyingiza mu kifo ekigazi awatali kunyigirizibwa;
N'ekyo ekiteekebwa ku mmeeza yo kyandijjudde obugimu.

37:
Oluvannyuma lwakwo eddoboozi ne liwuluguma;
Abwatuka n'eddoboozi ery'obukulu bwe:
So tabiziyiza eddoboozi lye bwe liwulirwa.

Kubanga agamba omuzira nti Gwa ku nsi;
Era bw'atyo bw'agamba oluwandaggirize,
N'empandaggirize ez'enkuba ye ey'amaanyi.

2:
Ekiragiro ndikibuulira:
Mukama yaŋŋamba nti Ggwe oli mwana wange;
Leero nkuzadde.

3:
Golokoka, ai Mukama: ondokole, ai Katonda wange:
Kubanga wakuba abalabe bange bonna ku ttama;
Wamenya amannyo g'ababi.

5:
Obasseeko omusango, ai Katonda;
Bagwe olw'okuteesa kwabwe bo:
Obasindike mu kwonoona kwabwe okungi;
Kubanga bakujeemedde ggwe.

6:
Okusinda kwange kunkooyezza;
Buli kiro nkulukusa ekiriri kyange;
Ekitanda kyange nkitobya n'amaziga.

9:
Abalabe baweddewo, baviibwamu emirembe egitaggwaawo;
N'ebibuga bye wamenya.
Era n'ekijjukizo kyabyo kizikiridde.

Era Mukama anaabeeranga kigo
ekiwanvu eri abayigganyizibwa,
Ekigo ekiwanvu mu biro eby'ennaku;

Onsaasire, ai Mukama;
Laba okubonaabona kwange kwe bankola abankyaye,
Ggwe annyimusa ku miryango egy'olumbe;

10:
Amakubo ge makakanyavu ennaku zonna;
Emisango gyo giri waggulu nnyo gy'atayinza kugirabira:
Abalabe be bonna abasooza.

Walaba; kubanga otunuulira ettima n'obukyayi, okussaako omukono gwo:
Omunafu yeewaayo gy'oli;
Wabanga omubeezi w'abo abataliiko kitaabwe.

11:
Mukama ali mu yeekaalu ye entukuvu,
Mukama, entebe ye eri mu ggulu;
Amaaso ge galaba abaana b'abantu, ebikowe bye bibakema.

12:
Olw'okunyagibwa kw'abaavu, olw'okusinda kw'abanafu,
Kaakano naagolokoka, Mukama bw'ayogera;
Naamuteeka mu mirembe gwe basooza.

Ebigambo bya Mukama bye bigambo ebirongoofu;
Nga ffeeza egezebwa mu kyoto ku nsi,
Erongoosebwa emirundi omusanvu.

15:
Amaaso ge ganyooma omubi;
Naye abatya Mukama abassaamu ekitiibwa.
Bw'alayira ne bw'afiirwa, takyuka.

16:
Onondaganga ekkubo ery'obulamu:
Gy'oli waliwo essanyu erituukirira;
Mu mukono gwo ogwa ddyo mwe muli ebisanyusa emirembe n'emirembe.

17:
Wagezaako omutima gwange; wajja gye ndi ekiro;
Wankema, n'otolaba kigambo;
Mmaliridde akamwa kange obutayonoonanga.

Golokoka, ai Mukama,
Omuyimirire mu maaso, omumegge wansi:
Omponye emmeeme yange eri omubi n'ekitala kyo;

18:
Mukama lwe lwazi lwange, era kye kigo kyange, era ye andokola;
Katonda wange, olwazi lwange olunywevu, oyo gwe ŋŋenda okwesiganga;
Engabo yange, n'ejjembe ery'obulokozi bwange, ekigo kyange ekigulumivu.

Era Mukama n'abwatuka mu ggulu,
N'oyo ali waggulu ennyo n'aleeta eddoboozi lye;
Ne waba amayinja ag'omuzira n'amanda ag'omuliro.

Katonda, ekkubo lye lyatuukirira:
Ekigambo kya Mukama kyakettebwa;
Oyo ye ngabo y'abo bonna abamwesiga.

Omponyezza mu kuyomba kw'abantu;
Onfudde omutwe gw'amawanga;
Abantu be ssaamanyanga balimpeereza.

Obulokozi bukulu bw'awa kabaka we;
Era amukolera eby'ekisa oyo gwe yasiiga amafuta,
Dawudi n'ezzadde lye, emirembe n'emirembe.

19:
Era ne mu by'amalala oziyize omuddu wo;
Bireme okumpangula: bwe ntyo bwe nnaabanga eyatuukirira,
So omusango ogw'okwonoona okunene tegulinsinga.

20:
Akuweerezenga okubeerwa mu
kifo ekitukuvu,
Akuwenga amaanyi agava mu Sayuuni;

Kaakano mmanyi nga Mukama alokola oyo gwe yasiiga amafuta;
Alimuddamu ng'ayima mu ggulu lye ettukuvu
N'obulokozi obuwonya obw'omukono gwe ogwa ddyo.

22:
Amaanyi gange gakaliridde ng'olugyo;
N'olulimi lwange lwegatta n'emba zange;
Era ondeese mu nfuufu ey'okufa.

Kubanga embwa zinneetoolodde:
Ekibiina ky'abo abakola obubi bantaayizizza;
Bampummudde engalo zange n'ebigere byange.

Mmwe abatya Mukama, mumutenderezenga;
Mmwe mwenna ezzadde lya Yakobo, mumugulumizenga;
Mumutyenga mmwe mwenna ezzadde lya Isiraeri.

Kubanga teyanyooma so teyakyawa nnaku z'oyo anakuwala;
So teyamukisa amaaso ge;
Naye bwe yamukoowoola, n'awulira.

24:
Oyo alina emikono emirungi, n'omutima omulongoofu;
Atayimusanga mmeeme ye eri ebitaliimu,
So teyalayiriranga bwereere.

Muyimuse emitwe gyammwe, mmwe enzigi;
Nammwe muyimuke, mmwe bawankaaki abataggwaawo:
Ne kabaka ow'ekitiibwa anaayingira.

Muyimuse emitwe gyammwe, mmwe enzigi;
Kale, mugiyimuse, mmwe bawankaaki abataggwaawo:
Ne Kabaka ow'ekitiibwa anaayingira.

25:
Ai Katonda wange, naakwesiganga ggwe,
Toŋŋanya kukwatibwa nsonyi;
Abalabe bange tobaganya kumpangula.

Onnuŋŋamye mu mazima go, onjigirize;
Kubanga ggwe oli Katonda ow'obulokozi bwange;
Ggwe gwe nnindirira obudde okuziba.

27:
Ekigambo kimu nkisabye Mukama, kye nnaanoonyanga;
Okutuulanga mu nnyumba ya Mukama ennaku zonna ez'obulamu bwange,
Okutunuuliranga obulungi bwa Mukama, n'okubuuzanga mu yeekaalu ye.

Kubanga ku lunaku olw'okunakuwala alinkuuma mu kyama mu nnyumba ye:
Awakwekerwa mu weema ye we alinkisiza;
Alinnyimusa ku lwazi.

Ne kaakano omutwe gwange gunaayimusibwa ku balabe bange abanneetoolodde;
Era naawaayo mu weema ye ssaddaaka ez'okusanyuka;
Naayimbanga, weewaawo, naayimba okutendereza Mukama.

Tonkisa amaaso go;
Togoba muddu wo mu busungu:
Ggwe wabeeranga omubeezi wange;
Tonsuula, so tondeka ai Katonda ow'obulokozi bwange.

Onjigirizenga ekkubo lyo, ai Mukama;
Era onnuŋŋamyenga mu luwenda olulabika,
Olw'abalabe bange.

Lindirira Mukama:
Ddamu amaanyi, ogume omwoyo gwo;
Weewaawo, lindirira Mukama.

28:
Obawe ng'emirimu gyabwe bwe giri era ng'obubi obw'ebikolwa byabwe:
Obawe ng'emikono gyabwe bwe gikola;
Obasasule bye basaanidde.

Mukama ge maanyi gange era
ye ngabo yange;
Omutima gwange gwamwesiganga oyo, ne mbeerwa:
Omutima gwange kyeguva gusanyuka ennyo;
Era naamutenderezanga n'oluyimba lwange.

29:
Mukama yatuula nga kabaka ku Mataba;
Weewaawo, Mukama atuula nga
kabaka emirembe gyonna.

31:
Naasanyukanga, naajaguzanga okw'okusaasira kwo:
Kubanga walaba ebibonoobono byange;
Wamanya emmeeme yange mu kulaba ennaku:

Emimwa egy'obulimba gisiruwalenga;
Egyogera ku batuukirivu n'ekyejo,
N'amalala n'okunyooma.

32:
Ne nkwatulira ekibi kyange, n'obutali butuukirivu bwange ne ssibukweka:
Nayogera nti Mukama naamwatulira ebyonoono byange;
Naawe n'onsonyiwa obutali butuukirivu obw'ekibi kyange.(Seera)

35:
Okuzikirira kumujjeko nga talaba;
N'ekyambika kye kye yakisa kimukwate ye yennyini:
Akigwemu n'okuzikirira.

Naye nze, bwe baalwala, nayambala bibukutu:
Ne nteganya emmeeme yange n'okusiiba;
N'okusaba kwange ne kudda mu kifuba kyange.

Naye bwe nnawenyera nze, ne basanyuka, ne bakuŋŋaana:
Abagwagwa ne bankuŋŋaanirako, ne ssimanya;
Ne banjuza, ne batalekaayo:

36:
Ateesa obutali butuukirivu ku kitanda kye;
Yeeteeka mu kkubo eritali ddungi;
Takyawa bubi.

Obutuukirivu bwo buli ng'ensozi za Katonda;
Emisango gyo bwe buziba obunene:
Ai Mukama, ggwe owonya abantu n'ebisolo.

Eri gye bagudde abakola obutali
butuukirivu;
Bameggeddwa wansi, so tebaayinzenga kuyimuka.

37:
Ababi basowodde ekitala, baleeze omutego gwabwe;
Okusuula omwavu n'omunafu,
Okutta abo abatambulira mu kkubo n'amazima.

Nali muto, kaakano nkaddiye;
Naye sirabanga mutuukirivu ng'alekeddwa,
Newakubadde ezzadde lye nga basaba emmere.

38:
Era n'abo abanjigganya obulamu bwange banteega;
N'abo abaagala nze okulaba akabi boogera eby'ettima,
Era balowooza eby'obulimba obudde okuziba.

39:
Omutima gwange ne gwaka munda yange;
Bwe nnali ndowooza, omuliro ne gukoleera:
Ne ndyoka njogera n'olulimi lwange:

Mukama, ontegeeze enkomerero yange,
N'ekigera eky'ennaku zange bwe kiri;
Ntegeere bwe ndi omumenyefu.

Laba, ennaku zange wazikola ng'enta;
N'obulamu bwange buli nga si kintu gy'oli:
Mazima, buli muntu, bw'anywerera ddala, mukka bukka.(Seera)

40:
Ssaddaaka n'ebiweebwayo tobisanyukira;
Amatu gange ogawulizza:
Ebyokebwa n'ebiweebwayo olw'ebibi tewabyagala.

Nsanyuka okukola by'oyagala, ai Katonda wange;
Weewaawo, amateeka go gali
mu mutima gwange munda.

Mbuulidde obutuukirivu mu kibiina ekinene;
Laba, ssiibunizenga mimwa gyange,
Ai Mukama, ggwe omanyi.

Sikwekanga butuukirivu bwo mu mutima gwange munda;
Mbuulidde obwesige bwo n'obulokozi bwo:
Ekisa kyo n'amazima go sibikisanga ekibiina ekinene.

Kubanga obubi obutabalika bunneetoolodde,
Obutali butuukirivu bwange buntuuseeko n'okuyinza ne ssiyinza kutunula waggulu;
Businga enviiri ez'oku mutwe gwange obungi, era omutima gwange gundese.

Naye nze ndi mwavu, neetaaga;
Mukama andowooza:
Ggwe oli mubeezi wange era omulokozi wange;
Tolwawo, ai Katonda wange.

41:
Era ne bw'ajja okundaba, ayogera ebitaliimu;
Omutima gwe gwekuŋŋaanyiza obutali butuukirivu:
Bw'ava mu nnyumba, abubuulira.

43:
Ne ndyoka ŋŋenda ku kyoto kya Katonda,
Eri Katonda essanyu lyange eritasingika;
Ne ku nnanga ndikutendereza, ai Katonda, Katonda wange.

45:
Ggwe osinga abaana b'abantu obulungi;
Ekisa kifukiddwa ku mimwa gyo:
Katonda kyeyava akuwa omukisa emirembe gyonna.

Obusaale bwo bwa bwogi;
Amawanga gagwa wansi mu maaso go;
Buli mu mutima gw'abalabe ba kabaka.

46:
Aggyawo entalo okutuusa ku nkomerero y'ensi;
Amenya omutego, n'effumu alikutula;
N'amagaali agookya omuliro.

48:
Mwekalirize enkomera zaakyo.
Mulowooze amayumba gaakyo;
Mulyoke mubibuulire emirembe egigenda okujja.

49:
Balowooza munda ng'ennyumba zaabwe za nnaku zonna,
Ebifo byabwe bya mirembe gyonna;
Batuuma ensi zaabwe amannya gaabwe bo.

Bateekerwawo magombe ng'ekisibo;
Okufa kunaabeeranga omusumba waabwe:
Ab'amazima banaabafuganga obudde bwe bulikya;
N'obulungi bwabwe buliba obw'emagombe, okubulya, buleme okubeera n'ekifo eky'okutuulamu.

50:
Katonda waffe alijja, so talisirika;
Omuliro gulirya mu maaso ge,
Omuyaga omungi gulimwetooloola.

Muwulire, abantu bange, nange naayogera;
Ggwe isiraeri, nange naakutegeeza;
Nze Katonda, Katonda wo.

Buli ampa ssaddaaka ey'okwebaza angulumiza;
Naye alongoosa obulungi ekkubo lye
Ndimulaga obulokozi bwa Katonda.

52:
Laba, ye wuuyo ataafuula Katonda maanyi ge;
Naye ne yeesiga obugagga bwe obungi,
Ne yeenyweza mu bubi bwe.

53:
Awatali kya kutya we batiira ennyo:
Kubanga Katonda asaasaanyizza amagumba g'oyo akukolako olusiisira;
Obakwasizza ensonyi, kubanga Katonda yabagoba.

55:
Kubanga omulabe si ye yanvuma;
Nandiyinzizza okugumiikiriza:
So si oyo eyankyawa eyanneegulumirizaako;
Nandyekwese mu maaso ge:

Naye ggwe, ai Katonda, olibassa mu bunnya obw'okuzikirira:
Abantu abaagala omusaayi n'ab'obulimba tebalimala kitundu kya nnaku zaabwe;
Naye nze neesiganga ggwe.

56:
Mu Katonda ndyebaza ekigambo kye:
Katonda gwe nneesize, siritya;
Ab'omubiri bayinza kunkola ki?

Ggwe obala okutambulatambula kwange:
Oteeke amaziga gange mu kasumbi ko;
Tegawandiikibwa mu kitabo kyo?

57:
Bateekeddeteekedde akatimba ebigere byange;
Emmeeme yange ekutamye:
Bansimidde obunnya mu kkubo lyange;
Babuguddemu wakati bo bennyini.(Seera)

59:
Kubanga, laba, bateega emmeeme yange;
Ab'amaanyi bakuŋŋaana okunnumba:
Si lwa kyonoono kyange, so si lwa kibi kyange, ai Mukama.

60:
Gireyaadi wange, era Manase wange;
Efulayimu naye yakuuma omutwe gwange;
Yuda gwe muggo gwange ogw'obwakabaka.

Mowaabu kye kinaabirwamu kyange;
Edomu ndimukasukira engatto yange:
Ggwe Firisutiya, yogerera waggulu ku lwange.

62:
Kino kyokka kye bateesa okumujeeza mu bukulu bwe;
Basanyukira eby'obulimba:
Boogera eby'omukisa n'akamwa kaabwe, naye bakolima munda.(Seera)

Mumwesige ye mu biro byonna, mmwe abantu;
Mufuke omutima gwammwe mu maaso ge:
Katonda kye kiddukiro gye tuli.(Seera)

Mazima abantu abatali ba kitiibwa gwe mukka, n'abo ab'ekitiibwa ekingi bwe bulimba:
Bwe baliteekebwa mu kigera, baliyimuka;
Bombiriri omukka gubasinga okuzitowa.

Katonda yayogera omulundi gumu,
Mpulidde bwe ntyo emirundi ebiri;
Nga Katonda ye nannyini buyinza:

63:
Naye kabaka alisanyukira Katonda:
Buli amulayira ye alyenyumiriza;
Kubanga akamwa k'abo aboogera eby'obulimba kalizibibwa.

64:
Bagumyagana emyoyo mu kuteesa obubi;
Bateesa okutega emitego mu kyama;
Boogera nti Anaagiraba ani?

Era abantu bonna banaatyanga;
Ne batendera omulimu gwa Katonda,
Ne balowooza n'amagezi bye yakola.

65:
Ofukirira ensalosalo zaayo amazzi amangi;
Olongoosa ebibibi byayo:
Ogigonza n'oluwandaggirize;
Okuwa omukisa okumera kwayo.

Amalundiro gambala ebisibo;
Era n'ebiwonvu bibikkiddwa eŋŋaano:
Byogerera waggulu olw'essanyu, era biyimba.

66:
Ensi yonna erikusinza,
Erikuyimbira ggwe;
Baliyimbira erinnya lyo.(Seera)

Afuga n'amaanyi ge emirembe gyonna;
Amaaso ge gatunuulira amawanga:
Abajeemu balemenga okwegulumiza.(Seera)

Weebagaza abantu okulinnya ku mitwe gyaffe;
Twayita mu muliro ne mu mazzi;
Naye watuggyamu n'otuyingiza mu kifo eky'obugagga.

Naakuwa ebyokwokya ebya ssava,
N'ebyokwoteza eby'endiga eza seddume;
Naawaayo ente n'embuzi.(Seera)

68:
Mumuyimbire Katonda, muyimbe okutendereza erinnya lye:
Mumukubire oluguudo oyo eyeebagalira mu malungu;
YA lye linnya lye; era mujagulize mu maaso ge.

Olinnye waggulu, osibye obusibe bwo;
Oweereddwa ebirabo mu bantu,
Era ne mu bajeemu, Mukama Katonda alyoke atuulenga wamu nabo.

70:
Bonna abakunoonya bakusanyukirenga bajaguzenga;
N'abo abaagala obulokozi bwo boogerenga bulijjo nti
Katonda agulumizibwenga.

Naye nze ndi mwavu, sirina kintu;
Oyanguwe okujja gye ndi, ai Katonda:
Ggwe oli mubeezi wange era omulokozi wange;
Ai Mukama, tolwawo.

71:
Obeerenga gye ndi olwazi olw'okutuulangako, we nnaayinzanga okweyuna bulijjo:
Walagira okundokola;
Kubanga ggwe oli lwazi lwange era ekigo kyange.

Akamwa kange kanaatenderanga obutuukirivu bwo,
N'obulokozi bwo okuzibya obudde;
Kubanga omuwendo gwabyo sigumanyi.

72:
Era banaabanga balamu; naye anaaweebwanga ku zaabu ey'e Syeba:
Era abantu banaamusabiranga bulijjo;
Banaamwebazanga okuzibya obudde.

Wanaabangawo emmere enkalu nnyingi mu nsi ku ntikko y'ensozi;
Ebibala byayo binaayuuganga nga Lebanooni:
N'ab'ekibuga banaameranga ng'omuddo ogw'oku nsi.

Erinnya lye linaabeereranga emirembe gyonna;
Erinnya lye linaalwangawo ng'enjuba:
N'abantu banaalabanga omukisa mu ye;
Amawanga gonna ganaamuyitanga wa Mukisa.

N'erinnya lye ery'ekitiibwa lyebazibwenga emirembe gyonna;
Era ensi zonna zijjuzibwenga ekitiibwa kye.
Amiina, era Amiina.

74:
Ojjukire ekibiina kyo kye wagula edda,
Kye wanunula okuba ekika eky'obusika bwo;
N'olusozi Sayuuni, lwe watuulangamu.

Tetukyalaba bubonero bwaffe;
Tewakyali nnabbi n'omu;
So temuli n'omu mu ffe ategeera ebyo gye birituusa okubaawo.

75:
Kubanga mu mukono gwa Mukama ekikompe mwekiri, n'omwenge gwamu guliko ejjovu;
Kijjudde ogutabuddwamu, n'akifuka;
Mazima ebbonda lyagwo ababi bonna ab'ensi balirikutamira, balirinywa.

77:
Ku lunaku olw'okunakuwala kwange nanoonya Mukama;
Omukono gwange ne gugololebwa ekiro ne gutaddirira;
Emmeeme yange n'egaana okusanyusibwa.

Njijukira oluyimba lwange ekiro:
Ne nteesa ebigambo n'omutima gwange nzekka;
N'omwoyo gwange gwanoonyeza ddala.

Amazzi gaakulaba, ai Katonda;
Amazzi gaakulaba, ne gatya:
Era n'obuziba ne bukankana.

Ebire ne bitonnya amazzi;
Eggulu ne lireeta eddoboozi:
Era n'obusaale bwo ne bubuna.

Eddoboozi ery'okubwatuka kwo ne liba mu kikuŋŋunta;
Okumyansa ne kumulisa ebintu byonna:
Ensi n'ekankana n'eyuuguuma.

78:
Laba, yakuba ejjinja amazzi ne gatiiriika,
Emigga ne gikulukuta;
Era ayinza okuwa n'omugaati? Alirabira ennyama abantu be?

Yakubira obusungu bwe ekkubo,
Teyasaasira mmeeme zaabwe okufa,
Naye n'awaayo obulamu bwabwe eri olumbe;

81:
Wakoowoola bwe wali mu nnaku, nange ne nkuwonya;
Ne nkuddiramu mu kifo eky'ekyama eky'okubwatuka:
Nakukemera ku mazzi ag'e Meriba.(Seera)

82:
Tebamanya so tebategeera;
Batambulatambula mu kizikiza:
Emisingi gyonna egy'ensi gisagaasagana.

83:
Bakwatibwenga ensonyi,
batyenga ennaku zonna;
Weewaawo, beeraliikirirenga bazikirirenga:

86:
Osanyuse emmeeme y'omuddu wo;
Kubanga nnyimusa emmeeme
yange eri ggwe, ai Mukama.

Otege okutu, ai Mukama, eri
okusaba kwange;
Owulire eddoboozi ery'okwegayirira kwange.

Naakutenderezanga, ai Mukama Katonda wange, n'omutima gwange gwonna;
Era naagulumizanga erinnya lyo
emirembe gyonna.

Kubanga okusaasira kwo kungi gye ndi;
Era wawonya emmeeme yange
mu bunnya obuli wansi ennyo.

Onkyukire, onsaasire;
Owe omuddu wo amaanyi go,
Olokole omwana w'omuzaana wo.

Ondage akabonero olw'obulungi;
Abankyaye bakalabe bakwatibwe ensonyi.
Kubanga ggwe, ai Mukama, onnyambye, era onsanyusizza.

87:
Ndyogera ku Lakabu ne Babulooni nga bali mu abo abammanyi:
Laba Firisutiya, ne Ttuulo, ne Esiyoopya;
Oyo yazaalirwa omwo.

88:
Onjawukanyirizza wala n'abo be mmanyi;
Onfudde ekitama eri abo:
Nsibiddwa, so siyinza kuvaamu.

89:
Mu biro biri wagambira abatukuvu bo mu kwolesebwa,
N'oyogera nti Ntadde obuyambi ku muntu ow'amaanyi;
Ngulumizizza omuntu eyalondebwa mu bantu.

Abaana be bwe banaalekanga
amateeka gange,
Ne batatambuliranga mu misango gyange;

90:
Ennaku z'emyaka gyaffe gye myaka nsanvu,
Era naye amaanyi gaweza emyaka ekinaana;
Naye amalala gaabwe kwe kutegana n'okunakuwala kwereere;
Kubanga gayita mangu, naffe ne tubula.

91:
Abantu olukumi baligwira ku lubiriizi lwo,
Era akakumi ku mukono gwo ogwa ddyo;
Tekulikusemberera ggwe.

Alinkaabira, nange ndimuyita;
Naabeeranga wamu naye bw'anaanakuwalanga:
Ndimuwonya, ndimuwa ekitiibwa.

92:
Ababi bwe baloka ng'omuddo,
Era abakozi b'obubi bonna bwe babeera;
Kyebava beera bazikirizibwe emirembe gyonna:

Kubanga, laba, abalabe bo, ai Mukama,
Kubanga, laba, abalabe bo, balizikirira;
Abakozi b'obubi bonna balisaasaanyizibwa.

93:
Amazzi gayimusizza, Ai Mukama,
Amazzi gayimusizza eddoboozi lyago;
Amazzi gayimusa amayengo gaago.

94:
Era abaleeseeko obutali butuukirivu bwabwe bo,
Era alibazikiriza mu bubi bwabwe;
Mukama Katonda waffe alibazikiriza.

97:
Sayuuni yawulira n'asanyuka,
N'abawala ba Yuda ne bajaguza;
Olw'emisango gyo, ai Mukama.

99:
Era amaanyi ga kabaka gaagala omusango ogw'ensonga;
Ggwe onyweza obutuukirivu,
Otuukiriza omusango n'obutuukirivu mu Yakobo.

Musa ne Alooni mu bakabona be,
Ne Samwiri mu abo abakoowoola erinnya lye;
Baakaabira Mukama, n'abayitaba.

Mumugulumizenga Mukama Katonda waffe,
Musinzizenga ku lusozi lwe olutukuvu;
Kubanga Mukama Katonda waffe mutukuvu.

100:
Mumanye nga Mukama ye Katonda:
Oyo ye yatutonda, naffe tuli babe;
Tuli bantu be, era endiga ez'omu ddundiro lye.

101:
Siiteekenga kintu kyonna ekitasaana mu maaso gange:
Nkyawa omulimu gw'abo abakyama;
Tegwegattenga nange.

102:
Tonkisa maaso go ku lunaku olw'okunakuwala kwange:
Otege okutu kwo we ndi;
Ku lunaku lwe nkoowoolerako ompitabe mangu.

Ebyo biriggwaawo, naye ggwe onoobeereranga:
Weewaawo, ebyo byonna birikaddiwa ng'ekyambalo;
Olibiwaanyisa ng'ekyambalo, n'ebyo biriwaanyisibwa:

104:
Weebaze Mukama, ggwe emmeeme yange.
Ai Mukama Katonda wange, oli mukulu nnyo;
Oyambadde ekitiibwa n'obukulu.

Asimba empagi ez'enju ze mu mazzi;
Afuula ebire eggaali lye;
Atambulira ku biwaawaatiro by'empewo:

Amereza ente essubi,
N'omuddo okuweereza abantu;
Balyoke baggyenga emmere mu ttaka;

Okisa amaaso go, ne byeraliikirira;
Obiggyamu omukka gwabyo, ne bifa,
Ne bidda mu nfuufu yaabyo.

106:
Bajjajjaffe tebaategeera bya magero byo mu Misiri;
Ne batajjukira kusaasira kwo okungi;
Naye ne bajeemera ku nnyanja, ku Nnyanja Emmyufu.

Emirundi emingi yabawonya;
Naye ne baagala okujeema mu kuteesa kwabwe,
Ne bajeezebwa mu butali butuukirivu bwabwe.

108:
Gireyaadi wange; Manase wange;
Efulayimu naye yakuuma omutwe gwange;
Yuda gwe muggo gwange ogw'obwakabaka.

Mowaabu kye kinaabirwamu kyange;
Edomu ndimukasukira engatto yange:
Ndyogerera waggulu ku Firisutiya.

109:
Abaana be babe mmomboze, basabirizenga;
Banoonyenga emmere mu bifo
byabwe ebyazika.

Weewaawo, yayagala okukolima,
ne kutuuka gy'ali;
So teyasanyukira kusaba mukisa, ne gumuba wala.

111:
Yawa abantu be okununulwa;
Yalagira endagaano ye emirembe gyonna:
Erinnya lye ttukuvu, lya kitiibwa.

Mu kutya Mukama amagezi mwe gasookera;
Balina okutegeera okulungi bonna abakola bwe batyo;
Ettendo lye libeerera emirembe gyonna.

112:
Agabye, awadde abaavu;
Obutuukirivu bwe bubeerera emirembe gyonna:
Ejjembe lye lirigulumizibwa n'ekitiibwa.

Omubi alibiraba, alirumwa omwoyo;
Aliruma obujiji n'amannyo ge, alinyolwa:
Omubi by'ayagala birifa.

115:
Birina engalo, naye tebizikwasa kintu;
Birina ebigere, naye tebitambula;
So tebyogeza bulago bwabyo.

Mukama atujjukidde; alituwa omukisa;
Aliwa omukisa ennyumba ya Isiraeri;
Aliwa omukisa ennyumba ya Alooni.

116:
Ai Mukama, mazima nze ndi muddu wo:
Nze ndi muddu wo, era omwana w'omuzaana wo;
Osumuludde ebyansiba.

118:
Banneetoolodde ng'enjuki;
bazikidde ng'omuliro ogw'omu maggwa:
Mu linnya lya Mukama ndibazikiriza.

Mukama ge maanyi gange,
lwe luyimba lwange;
Era afuuse obulokozi bwange.

119:
Omutima gwange gutuukirire mu mateeka go;
Nnemenga okukwatibwa ensonyi.
KAFU

Onzuukize ng'ekisa kyo ekirungi bwe kiri;
Bwe ntyo bwe nnaakwatanga akamwa ko bye kategeeza.
LAMEDI

Ndabye ebintu byonna ebyatuukirira gye bikoma;
Naye ekiragiro kyo kigazi nnyo.
MEMU

Omubiri gwange gukankana olw'okukutya;
Era ntya emisango gyo.
AYINI

Kyenvudde ndowooza ebiragiro byo byonna eby'ebigambo byonna nga bya nsonga;
Era nkyaye buli kkubo ery'obulimba.
PE

Ekigambo kyo kyonna kyonna mazima;
N'emisango gyo egy'ensonga gyonna gyonna gibeerera emirembe gyonna.
SINI

Naakwatanga ebiragiro byo n'ebyo bye wategeeza;
Kubanga amakubo gange gonna gali mu maaso go.
TAWU

126:
Newakubadde nga yagenda ng'akaaba,
ng'atwala ensigo;
Alidda nate n'essanyu, ng'aleeta ebinywa bye.

129:
Newakubadde abayita teboogera
Nti Omukisa gwa Mukama gube ku mmwe;
Tubawadde omukisa mu linnya lya Mukama.

130:
Emmeeme yange eyaayaanira Mukama,
Okusinga abakuumi bwe bayaayaanira obudde okukya;
Weewaawo, okusinga abakuumi bwe bayaayaanira obudde okukya.

Ggwe Isiraeri, suubiranga Mukama;
Kubanga awali Mukama we wali okusaasira,
Era awali ye we wali okununula okungi.

131:
Mazima ŋŋonzezza emmeeme yange, ngisirisizza;
Ng'omwana avudde ku mabeere awali nnyina,
N'emmeeme yange eri we ndi bw'etyo ng'omwana avudde ku mabeere.

132:
Mukama yalayirira Dawudi mu mazima;
Talikyuka kugaleka:
Ku bibala eby'omubiri gwo nditeeka ku ntebe yo.

Kino kye kifo kye mpummuliramu ennaku zonna:
Wano we nnaatuulanga;
kubanga nayaayaanirawo.

133:
Kuliŋŋanga amafuta ag'omuwendo omungi agali ku mutwe,
Agaakulukutira mu kirevu,
Mu kirevu kya Alooni;
Agaaserengetera ku lukugiro lw'ebyambalo bye;

135:
Mumutendereze Mukama.
Mutendereze erinnya lya Mukama;
Mumutendereze, mmwe abaddu ba Mukama:

Mumutendereze Mukama;
kubanga Mukama mulungi:
Muyimbe okutendereza erinnya lye; kubanga lya ssanyu.

Anyoosa omukka okuva ku nkomerero z'ensi;
Aleetera enjota enkuba;
Afulumya empewo mu mawanika ge.

137:
Ggwe omuwala ow'e Babulooni, agenda okuzikirizibwa;
Aliba n'omukisa oyo alikuwalana ggwe,
Nga bwe watukola ffe.

138:
Mukama alituukiriza ebigambo ebinfaako:
Okusaasira kwo, ai Mukama, kubeerera emirembe gyonna;
Toleka mirimu gya mikono gyo ggwe.

139:
Naakwebazanga;
kubanga okukolebwa kwange kwa ntiisa, kwa kitalo:
Emirimu gyo gya kitalo;
N'ekyo emmeeme yange ekimanyidde ddala.

140:
Onkuume, ai Mukama, eri emikono gy'ababi;
Omponye eri omutemu:
Abateesezza okukyamya ebigere byange olw'amaanyi.

Ab'amalala bantegedde omutego n'emigwa;
Bayaze ekitimba mu kkubo:
Bantegedde ebyambika.(Seera)

Amanda agookya gabagweko:
Basuulibwe mu muliro;
Mu bunnya obuwanvu, baleme okugolokokanga nate.

141:
Omutuukirivu ankubenga nga kwa kisa;
Era ambuulirirenga, ng'amafuta ku mutwe;
Omutwe gwange gulemenga okugagaana:
Kuba newakubadde mu bubi bwabwe okusaba kwange kunaabeererangawo.

142:
Nakukoowoola ggwe, ai Mukama;
Nayogera nti Ggwe oli kiddukiro kyange,
Omugabo gwange mu nsi ey'abalamu.

Oggyeemu emmeeme yange mu kkomera, neebazenga erinnya lyo:
Abatuukirivu balinneetooloola;
Kubanga olinkolera eby'ekisa ekingi.

143:
Kubanga omulabe anjigganyizza emmeeme yange;
Akubye obulamu bwange n'abusuula wansi:
Antuuzizza mu bifo eby'enzikiza ng'abo abaafa edda.

Era mu kisa kyo ekirungi ozikirize abalabe bange,
Omalewo bonna ababonyaabonya emmeeme yange;
Kubanga ndi muddu wo.

144:
Ente zaffe bwe ziriba n'emigugu eminene;
Nga tewali kuwagula, newakubadde okufuluma,
So nga tewali kuyoogaana mu nguudo zaffe;

146:
Abatuukiririza omusango abajoogebwa;
Awa emmere abalumwa enjala;
Mukama asumulula abasibe;

Mukama azibula amaaso g'abazibe;
Mukama ayimiriza abakutama;
Mukama ayagala abatuukirivu;

Mukama akuuma bannaggwanga;
Awanirira atalina kitaawe ne nnamwandu;
Naye ekkubo ery'ababi alivuunikirira ddala.

147:
Mumutendereze Mukama;
Kubanga kulungi okuyimba okutenderezanga Katonda waffe;
Kubanga kwa ssanyu, era ettendo liwooma.

148:
Batendereze erinnya lya Mukama;
Kubanga erinnya lye yekka lye ligulumizibwa:
Ekitiibwa kye kiri kungulu ku nsi ne ku ggulu.

1:
Bwe boogera nti Jjangu tugende fenna,
Tuteege omusaayi,
Tugwire mu kyama ataliiko musango awatali nsonga;

Googerera waggulu mu kifo ekikulu eky'okukuŋŋaaniramu;
Awayingirirwa mu miryango,
Mu kibuga mwe galeetera ebigambo byago:

Entiisa yammwe bw'erituuka ng'omuyaga,
N'ennaku ze muliraba bwe zirijja ng'embuyaga ez'akazimu;
Okweraliikirira n'obubalagaze bwe biribajjira.

3:
Okusaasira n'amazima tebikulekanga:
Bisibenga mu bulago bwo;
Biwandiikenga ku bipande eby'omutima gwo:

Togambanga muliraanwa wo nti Genda okomewo,
Enkya ndikuwa;
Bwe kiri naawe.

4:
Era yanjigirizanga n'aŋŋamba nti
Omutima gwo gunywezenga ebigambo byange;
Kwatanga ebiragiro byange obeerenga omulamu:

5:
Ng'ennangaazi ekwagala n'empeewo ekusanyusa,
Amabeere ge gakumalenga mu biro byonna;
Era osanyukirenga bulijjo okwagala kwe.

6:
Kale nno, mwana wange, kola kino weerokole,
Kubanga ogudde mu mukono gwa muliraanwa wo;
Genda weetoowaze otayirire muliraanwa wo.

Bw'onootambulanga, linaakukulemberanga;
Bw'oneebakanga, linaakukuumanga:
Era bw'onoozuukukanga, linaayogeranga naawe.

7:
Amangu ago agenda amugoberera,
Ng'ente bw'egenda okusalibwa,
Oba ng'amasamba bwe gagenda okukangavvula omusirusiru;

Okutuusa akasaale lwe kalifumita ekibumba kye;
Ng'ennyonyi bw'eyanguwa okugwa mu kyambika,
So tamanyi ng'alifiirwa obulamu bwe.

8:
Okutya Mukama kwe kukyawa obubi;
Amalala n'essukuti n'ekkubo ebbi
N'akamwa akabambaavu bye nkyawa.

Kale nze nga ndi awo gy'ali ng'omukoza:
Era bulijjo yansanyukiranga,
Nga njaguliza bulijjo mu maaso ge;

19:
Okutya Mukama kuleeta bulamu:
N'oyo ali nakwo anaabeereranga awo nga kumumala;
Talijjirwa bubi.

23:
Kubanga nga bw'alowooza mu nda ye, bw'ali bw'atyo:
Lya, nywa, bw'akugamba;
Naye omutima gwe teguli wamu naawe.

Bankubye, bw'olyogera bw'otyo, ne ssirumwa;
Bankubye, ne ssiwulira:
Ndyebaka ddi? naagunoonya nate omulundi ogw'okubiri.

24:
Teekateekanga omulimu gwo ebweru,
Ogwetegekerenga mu nnimiro;
Oluvannyuma n'olyoka ozimba ennyumba yo.

25:
Kubanga waakiri bakugambe nti Yambuka wano;
N'otossibwa wansi mu maaso g'omulangira,
Amaaso go gwe galabye.

Ng'empewo eya serugi bw'ebeera mu biro eby'okukunguliramu,
Omubaka omwesigwa bw'abeera bw'atyo eri abo abamutuma;
Kubanga aweezaweeza emmeeme ya bakama be,

27:
Mukwano gwo ggwe ne mukwano gwa kitaawo tobaabuliranga;
So togendanga mu nnyumba ya muganda wo ku lunaku kw'olabira obuyinike:
Muliraanwa wo akuli okumpi akira ow'oluganda ali ewala.

30:
Ggyangawo ebigambo ebitaliimu n'eby'obulimba bibe wala nange:
Tompanga bwavu newakubadde obugagga;
Ndisanga emmere gye nneetaaga:

Amagombe; n'olubuto olugumba;
N'ensi etekkuta mazzi;
N'omuliro ogutayogera nti Lekera awo.

Ekkubo ery'empungu mu bbanga;
Ekkubo ery'omusota ku lwazi;
Ekkubo ery'eryato wakati mu nnyanja;
N'ekkubo ery'omusajja n'omuwala.

Bwe lityo bwe libeera ekkubo ery'omukazi omwenzi;
Alya n'asangula ku mimwa gye,
N'ayogera nti Siriiko bubi bwe nkoze.

1:
Amafuta go gawunya akaloosa;
Erinnya lyo liriŋŋanga amafuta agafukibwa;
Abawala abatamanyi musajja kyebava bakwagala.

2:
Ebimuli birabise ku ttaka;
Ebiro bituuse ennyonyi mwe ziyimbira,
N'eddoboozi lya kaamukuukulu liwulirwa mu nsi yaffe;

Ai ejjiba lyange, abeera mu njatika ez'omu jjinja, mu bwekwekero obw'ebbanga,
Ndabe amaaso go, mpulire eddoboozi lyo;
Kubanga eddoboozi lyo ddungi, n'amaaso go ga kusanyusa.

3:
Laba, ke kadyeri ka Sulemaani;
Abasajja ab'amaanyi nkaaga bakeetoolodde,
Ku basajja ab'amaanyi aba Isiraeri.

4:
Osanyusizza omutima gwange, mwannyinaze, mugole wange;
Osanyusizza omutima gwange, n'eriiso lyo erimu,
N'omukuufu ogumu ogw'omu bulago bwo.

Okwagala kwo nga kulungi, mwannyinaze, mugole wange!
Okwagala kwo nga kusinga nnyo omwenge;
N'amafuta go ag'omugavu nga gasinga nnyo eby'akaloosa eby'engeri zonna okuwunya obulungi.

Emimwa gyo, ai mugole wange, gitonnya ng'ebisenge by'enjuki:
Omubisi gw'enjuki n'amata biri wansi w'olulimi lwo;
N'okuwunya kw'ebyambalo byo kuli ng'okuwunya kwa Lebanooni.

Omugavu ne kalikomu,
Kalamo ne kinamomo, n'emiti gyonna egy'omugavu;
Mooli ne akalosi, wamu n'eby'akaloosa byonna ebisinga obulungi.

5:
Nzize mu nnimiro yange, mwannyinaze mugole wange:
Nnoze mooli yange n'eby'akaloosa byange;
Ndidde ebisenge byange eby'enjuki n'omubisi gwange;
Nnywedde omwenge gwange n'amata gange.
Mulye, mmwe ab'omukwano;
Munywe, weewaawo, mukkute, mmwe baganzi bange.

Ne nzigulirawo muganzi wange;
Naye muganzi wange yali nga yeegendedde, ng'avuddewo.
Omwoyo gwange gubadde guntyemuse bw'ayogedde:
Ne mmunoonya, naye ne ssiyinza kumulaba;
Ne mmuyita, naye n'atanziramu.

Abakuumi abatambulatambula mu kibuga ne bandaba,
Ne bankuba ne banfumita;
Abakuumi ba bbugwe ne banziyako omunagiro gwange.

6:
Ejjiba lyange, owange ataliiko bbala, ali omu yekka;
Mwana wa nnyina omu yekka;
Mulonde w'omukazi amuzaala.
Abawala baamulaba ne bamuyita eyaweebwa omukisa;
Bakabaka abakazi n'abazaana baamulaba ne bamutendereza.

7:
Omutwe gwo guli ku ggwe nga Kalumeeri,
N'enviiri ez'oku mutwe gwo ng'olugoye olw'effulungu;
Kabaka emibumbo gyazo gimusiba.

8:
Sulemaani yalina olusuku lw'emizabbibu e Baalukamooni;
Yasigira olusuku abalimi;
Olw'ebibala byamu buli muntu yasalirwa ebitundu ebya ffeeza lukumi.

Olusuku lwange olw'emizabbibu, olwange, luli mu maaso gange;
Ggwe, Sulemaani, onoobanga n'olukumi olwo,
N'abo abakuuma ebibala byamu bikumi bibiri.

38:
Ng'akataayi oba sekanyolya, bwe nnavulungutana bwe ntyo;
Nawuubaala nga kaamukuukulu: amaaso gange gafuuyirira olw'okulalama;
Ai Mukama, njoogebwa; ggwe beera muyima wange.

Laba, olw'emirembe gyange kyennava mbalagalwa ennyo:
Naye ggwe olw'okwagala obulamu bwange obuwonyezza mu bunnya obuvundirwamu;
Kubanga osudde ebibi byange byonna ennyuma w'amabega go.

1:
Yuda agenze mu busibe olw'okubonyaabonyezebwa n'olw'obuddu obuzito;
Abeera mu bannaggwanga, talaba kiwummulo:
Bonna abamuyigganya bamukwatira wabi.

Amakubo ga Sayuuni gakaaba, kubanga tewali ajja eri okukuŋŋaana okutukuvu;
Emiryango gye gyonna girekeddwawo, bakabona be basinda:
Bawala be baliko obuyinike, naye yennyini abalagalwa.

Abalabe be bafuuse omutwe, abamukyawa balabye omukisa;
Kubanga Mukama amubonyaabonyezza olw'olufulube lw'ebyonoono bye:
Abaana be abato bagenze mu kusibibwa mu maaso g'omulabe.

Empitambi ye yali mu birenge bye; teyajjukira nkomerero ye ya luvannyuma;
Kyavudde akkakkanyizibwa ddala; talina amusanyusa:
Ai Mukama, tunuulira okubonyaabonyezebwa kwange; kubanga omulabe yeegulumizizza.

Abantu be bonna bassa ebikkowe, banoonya emmere;
Bawaddeyo ebintu byabwe ebisanyusa okugula emmere okuweezaweeza emmeeme yaabwe:
Tunula, ai Mukama, olabe; kubanga nfuuse ataliiko ky'agasa.

Ekikoligo ky'ebyonoono byange omukono gwe gwe gukisibye;
Byezinzezinze, birinnye ku nsingo yange; amazeewo amaanyi gange:
Mukama angabudde mu mikono gy'abo be siyinza kuyimirira mu maaso gaabwe.

Mukama anyoomye abasajja bange bonna ab'amaanyi wakati mu nze;
Ankuŋŋaanyirizzaako okukuŋŋaana okutukuvu okubetenta abalenzi bange:
Mukama asambye omuwala wa Yuda atamanyi musajja nga mu ssogolero.

Olw'ebyo kyenvudde nkaaba amaziga; eriiso lyange, eriiso lyange likulukuta amazzi;
Kubanga omukubagiza eyandisanyusizza emmeeme yange andi wala:
Abaana bange balekeddwawo kubanga omulabe awangudde.

Sayuuni ayanjuluzza emikono gye; tewali wa kumukubagiza;
Mukama alagidde ebya Yakobo abo abamwetoolodde babeere abalabe be:
Yerusaalemi ali mu bo ng'ekintu ekitali kirongoofu.

Tunula, ai Mukama; kubanga ndi munaku: emmeeme yange yeeraliikiridde;
Omutima gwange gukyuse munda yange; kubanga njeemye nnyo nnyini:
Ebweru ekitala kinnyaga, mu nju mulimu ng'okufa.

Bawulidde nga nzisa ebikkowe; tewali wa kunkubagiza;
Abalabe bange bonna bawulidde ennaku ze ndabye; basanyuse kubanga okireese:
Olireeta olunaku lwe walangirira, nabo balifaanana nze.

Obubi bwabwe bwonna butuuke mu maaso go;
Era obakole bo nga bw'onkoze nze olw'okusobya kwange kwonna:
Kubanga ebikkowe bye nzisa bingi, n'omutima gwange guyongobedde.

2:
Mukama amize ennyumba zonna eza Yakobo, so takwatiddwa kisa;
Asudde ebifo eby'amaanyi eby'omuwala wa Yuda olw'obusungu bwe;
Abakkakkanyizza okutuuka ku ttaka:
Ayonoonye obwakabaka n'abakungu baamu.

Amazeewo ejjembe lyonna erya 2 Isiraeri ng'aliko ekiruyi;
Azzizzaayo omukono gwe ogwa ddyo mu maaso g'omulabe:
Era ayokezza Yakobo ng'omuliro ogwaka ennyo, ogwokya enjuyi zonna.

Mukama ateesezza okuzikiriza bbugwe ow'omuwala wa Sayuuni;
Aleeze omugwa, omukono gwe taguzizzaayo okuleka okuzikiriza:
Naye akungubazizza olukomera ne bbugwe; biggweerawo wamu.

Emiryango gye gibulidde mu ttaka; azikirizza amenye ebisiba bye:
Kabaka we n'abakungu be bali mu mawanga eteri mateeka;
Weewaawo, bannabbi be tebalaba kwolesebwa okuvudde eri Mukama.

Abakadde ab'omuwala wa Sayuuni batudde ku ttaka, basirise;
Batadde enfuufu ku mitwe gyabwe; beesibye ebibukutu:
Abawala ba Yerusaalemi bakoteka emitwe.

Amaaso gange gaziba olw'amaziga, emmeeme yange yeeraliikiridde,
Ekibumba kyange kifukiddwa ku ttaka olw'okuzikirira kw'omuwala w'abantu bange;
Kubanga abaana abato n'abayonka bazirikira mu nguudo ez'omu kibuga

Bannabbi bo bakulabidde okwolesebwa okutaliimu okw'obusirusiru;
So tebakunnyonnyodde obutali butuukirivu bwo, okukomyawo obusibe bwo:
Naye bakulabidde emigugu egitaliimu n'ensonga ez'okugobebwa.

Bonna abayitawo bakukubira mu ngalo;
Basooza ne banyeenyereza omutwe gwabwe omuwala wa Yerusaalemi nga boogera nti
Kino kye kibuga abantu kye baayitanga nti Obulungi obw'Abatuukirira, Essanyu ery'ensi zonna?

Abalabe bo bonna bakwasamidde nnyo akamwa kaabwe;
Basooza ne baluma obujigi; boogera nti Tumumize;
Mazima luno lwe lunaku lwe twasuubira; tulusanze, tululabye.

Mukama akoze ekyo kye yateesa;
Atuukirizza ekigambo kye kye yalagira mu nnaku ez'edda;
Asudde so tasaasidde:
Era awadde omulabe okukusanyukirako,
Agulumizizza ejjembe ly'abo abakukyawa.

Omutima gwabwe gwakaabira Mukama:
Ai bbugwe ow'omuwala wa Sayuuni, amaziga gakulukute ng'omugga emisana n'ekiro;
Teweewummuza n'akatono; emmunye y'eriiso lyo terekangayo.

Omulenzi n'omukadde bagalamidde ku ttaka mu nguudo;
Abawala bange n'abalenzi bange bagudde n'ekitala:
Obattidde ku lunaku olw'obusungu bwo; osse so tosaasidde.

4:
Okubonereza obutali butuukirivu bwo kutuukiridde, ai omuwala wa Sayuuni;
Takyakutwala nate mu busibe:
Alibonereza obutali butuukirivu bwo, ai omuwala wa Edomu;
Alikunnyonnyola ebibi byo.

2:
N'ayogera nti
Nakaabirira Mukama kubanga nalaba ennaku, N'anziramu;
Mu lubuto lw'emagombe nakoowoola;
N'owulira eddoboozi lyange.

Kubanga wansuula mu buziba, mu mutima ogw'ennyanja,
Amataba ne ganneetooloola;
Amayengo go gonna n'amasingiisira go gaayita waggulu ku nze.

Amazzi gansaanikira, era okutuuka ku bulamu;
Obuziba bwanneetooloola;
Endago zambikka ku mutwe gwange.

Ne nzika ensozi we zisibuka;
Ensi n'ebisiba byayo ne binzigalira emirembe gyonna;
Naye oggyeemu obulamu bwange mu bunnya, ai Mukama, Katonda wange.

Naye nze naakuwa ssaddaaka yange n'eddoboozi ery'okwebaza;
Naasasula obweyamo bwange.
Obulokozi buva eri Mukama.

3:
N'okumasamasa kwe kwali ng'omusana;
Yalina amayembe nga gava mu mukono gwe:
Era omwo mwe mwali okukweka amaanyi ge.

Yayimirira n'agera ensi;
Yatunula n'agoba amawanga n'agasalamu:
Ensozi ez'olubeerera ne zisaasaana,
Obusozi obutaggwaawo ne bukutama;
Okutambula kwe kwali nga bwe kwabanga obw'edda.

Omutego gwo gwasowolerwa ddala;
Ebirayiro bye walayirira ebika byali kigambo kya nkalakkalira.(Seera)
Ensi wagyasaamu n'emigga.

Enjuba n'omwezi ne biyimirira mu kifo kyabyo mwe bibeera;
Olw'okutangaala kw'obusaale bwo nga butambula,
Olw'okwakaayakana kw'effumu lyo erimasamasa.

Kubanga omutiini newakubadde nga tegwanya,
So n'emizabbibu nga tegiriiko bibala;
Ne bwe bateganira omuzeyituuni obwereere,
Ennimiro ne zitaleeta mmere yonna;
Embuzi nga zimaliddwawo ku kisibo,
So nga tewali nte mu biraalo:

1:
Laba, omuwala atamanyi musajja aliba olubuto, era alizaala omwana wa bulenzi,
Balimutuuma erinnya lye Emmanweri;
eritegeezebwa nti Katonda ali naffe.

13:
Naye Isaaya bye yalagula bibatuukiriridde, ebyayogera nti
Muliwulira buwulizi, naye temulitegeera;
Muliraba bulabi, naye temulyetegereza:

kituukirire ekyayogererwa mu nnabbi, ng'agamba nti
Ndyasamya akamwa kange mu ngero;
Ndireeta ebigambo ebyakwekebwa okuva ku kutondebwa kw'ensi.

1:
Nga bwe kyawandiikibwa mu nnabbi Isaaya nti
Laba, nze ntuma omubaka wange mu maaso go,
Alirongoosa oluguudo lwo;

Eddoboozi lye ayogerera waggulu mu ddungu nti
Mulongoose oluguudo lwa Mukama,
Muluŋŋamye amakubo ge;

13:
Laba, mmwe abanyooma, mwewuunye, mubule;
Kubanga nze nkola omulimu mu nnaku zammwe
Omulimu gwe mutalikkiriza newakubadde omuntu ng'agubabuulidde nnyo.

3:
Omumiro gwabwe ye ntaana eyasaamiridde;
Balimba n'ennimi zaabwe;
Obusagwa bw'embalasaasa buli wansi w'emimwa gyabwe:

9:
Era nga bw'ayogera mu Koseya nti
Ndibayita abantu bange, abatali bantu bange;
Era ataayagalwa, ayagaliddwa.

11:
era bwe kityo Abaisiraeri bonna balirokoka: nga bwe kyawandiikibwa nti
Muliva mu Sayuuni Awonya;
Aliggyawo obutatya Katonda mu Yakobo:

15:
Era nate nti
Mutenderezenga Mukama, mmwe ab'amawanga mwenna;
Era ebika byonna bimutenderezenga.

9:
nga bwe kyawandiikibwa nti
Yasaasaanya, yagabira abaavu;
Obutuukirivu bwe bwa lubeerera emirembe gyonna.

1:
naye ku Mwana ayogera nti
Entebe yo, ai Katonda, ya lubeerera emirembe n'emirembe;
N'omuggo ogw'obugolokofu gwe muggo ogw'obwakabaka bwo.

Wayagala obutuukirivu, n'okyawa obujeemu;
Katonda, Katonda wo, kyavudde akufukako
Amafuta ag'okusanyuka okusinga banno.

2:
Wamukola okubulako akatono okuba nga bamalayika;
Wamussaako engule ey'ekitiibwa n'ettendo,
N'omufuza emirimu egy'emikono gyo:

3:
Kyennava nnyiigira emirembe egyo,
Ne njogera nti Bakyama bulijjo mu mutima gwabwe:
Naye abo tebaategeera makubo gange;

7:
(kubanga bo baafuulibwa bakabona awatali kirayiro; naye oyo awamu n'ekirayiro yafuulibwa oyo amwogerako nti
Mukama yalayira, era talyejjusa, nti
Oli kabona okutuusa emirembe gyonna);

8:
Kubanga bw'abanenya ayogera nti
Laba, ennaku zijja, bw'ayogera Mukama,
Bwe ndiragaana endagaano empya n'ennyumba ya Isiraeri era n'ennyumba ya Yuda;

Kubanga eno ye ndagaano gye ndiragaana n'ennyumba ya Isiraeri
Oluvannyuma lw'ennaku ziri, bw'ayogera Mukama;
Nditeeka amateeka gange mu magezi gaabwe,
Era ne ku mutima gwabwe ndigawandiika;
Nange nnaabeeranga Katonda gye bali,
Nabo banaabeeranga bantu gye ndi:

10:
Ng'ajja mu nsi, kyava ayogera nti
Ssaddaaka n'ebiweebwayo tewabyagala,
Naye wanteekerateekera omubiri;

Eno ye ndagaano gye ndiragaana nabo
Oluvannyuma lw'ennaku ziri, bw'ayogera Mukama;
Nditeeka amateeka gange ku mutima gwabwe,
Era ne ku magezi gaabwe ndigawandiika;
n'alyoka ayogera nti

12:
era mwerabidde ekigambo ekibuulirira, ekyogera nammwe ng'abaana nti
Mwana wange, tonyoomanga kukangavvula kwa Mukama,
So toddiriranga bw'akunenyanga;

2:
era
Ejjinja eryesittalwako, era olwazi olusuula;
kubanga beesittala ku kigambo nga tebagonda; era kwe baateekerwawo.
